Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:08.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說了別想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:13.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你殺了史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:21.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我都那麼拚命想阻止了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:33.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快 讓它下潛就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:36.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:06.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:23.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:25.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣總算…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:43.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右側尾翼重創
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:44.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一引擎損傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主翼也受損
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:49.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出力降低 無法順利推進
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:52.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷注水 維持艦的姿勢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:55.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,分離第一引擎 爆破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:58.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,裝作被擊沉狀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:01:59.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:14.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:45.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ArchAngel…基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:50.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-35  混沌的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:31.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 海中還很混亂無法使用聲納
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:33.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被擊毀了的話浮游物不會那麼少
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:34.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,逃掉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,搜查隊擴大範圍搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:39.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別放過任何蛛絲馬跡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:49.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喲 幹得好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:50.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害啊 超級王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:52.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}真的好厲害啊 真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:55.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的幹掉了嗎 那個Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:57.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:58.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 那種戰鬥方式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:03.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:08.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得好 真
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:14.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧了雷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成功做到的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:23.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這絕對能拿勳章
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是無敵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:36.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經報仇了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:47.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括你的份
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:50.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:53.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 真
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:57.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉根本沒打算殺你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他總是做那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:02.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而你卻…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:03.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼報仇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:04.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:05.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼莫名奇妙的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,殺他就那麼開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:14.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼得意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:16.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼把他…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:18.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開心有錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:24.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於打敗強敵 不能高興嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你說該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:28.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哭泣悲傷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為他祈禱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:35.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說 對你來說 我被他殺了比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:40.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:41.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:42.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:43.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請住手 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:51.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 我承認真的態度有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:56.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但就算是長官 剛才的責問也太沒有道理了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:02.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊ArchAngel和Freedom是總部的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真出色地完成了使命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:09.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,收到稱讚也無可厚非
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:10.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:16.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他…根本沒有非要被殺的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:18.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:22.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉和ArchAngel 都不是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:24.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:25.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:29.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知對方企圖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:32.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但既然總部如此定論 就是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:35.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們是ZAFT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:45.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼是敵人 或者不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:49.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,依陣營有別 也因人而異
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都是相對的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:55.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡沒有絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:05.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們既是ZAFT 就要遵從議長和最高評議會
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們判定的敵人就是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:09.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:13.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你所說的話 只是個人感情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話令人困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:27.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:41.09,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}ZAFT軍 直布羅陀基地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:47.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,FM73魚雷管運至狄夫切利夫的第5魚雷艙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:51.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,B點 卡姆伽克來的補給部件10分後到達
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.87,0:08:54.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,修復資料庫更新中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:58.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認BABI的液體減壓器與GOUF發生誤裝配
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:09.03,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}ZAFT軍事站
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:13.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 雖說要攻擊Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:17.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長具體想要做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:20.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對知名企業產品實行抵制運動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:26.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是很嚴重的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:29.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比單純和聯合作戰嚴重許多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:30.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:33.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多少也自己想想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的腦袋只是裝飾品嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:41.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的腦袋就快爆炸了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:51.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我並不打算做對指名的人出兵這種蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:54.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂攻擊Logos並不是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:57.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:10:03.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要終結他們所創造的這個扭曲的戰爭體系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:11.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 是你們被騙了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被那些協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:16.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,協調者是錯誤的危險存在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是無法理解的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:21.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們為什麼會這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最初是在何時 何人說起的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在我看來 能夠坦然做出這種事的Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:34.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,更像是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:39.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而這些 都只是為了要和我們繼續作戰而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:47.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,威脅到自身安危 是人都會戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:49.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是本能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:53.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他們攻擊 迫使我們反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:57.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的歷史 就是這種悲哀的循環往復
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:07.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭結束就不需要兵器 舊的不去新的不來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:13.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不燒毁田地 就無法讓飢餓的民眾伸手借債
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:20.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和平的世界無法賺錢 無法謀利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:25.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此他們才要我們不斷作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:29.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是結束這種事的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們並不想相互殘殺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:37.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有這樣大量的武器 人們也可以活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:41.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不持續戰鬥 也可以活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:43.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走到一起來談談
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:47.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定能從他們製造的戰爭世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:49.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一起脫離出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:53.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:56.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Blue Cosmos的老大 揪出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:01.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暴徒都到宅邸了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾 想想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:09.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種…這種蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:11.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:15.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:31.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:34.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:41.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過太好了 聽醫生說傷勢並不嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.73,0:12:53.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,它被毀了的話我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:55.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼呢 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在別管這些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說是被Impulse打的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:01.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,活該
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:06.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是個很率直衝動的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:07.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,技術不停地長進
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:13.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見過面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:20.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一面之緣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:25.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 這艘船在忙什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上次還和我們戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:30.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是又和ZAFT…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,…為敵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:41.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:43.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 已經沒大礙了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ArchAngel的情況雖然也很嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:51.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要選擇條不易被發現的航線
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該能抵達奧布吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:55.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:02.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 你也吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:05.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是奧布的船嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:09.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這艘船…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:13.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:17.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那到奧布後打算把我怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穆 拉 佛拉卡這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:30.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:36.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法替代的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:45.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 已經不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:58.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:03.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後原則上可以多接受些這種申請
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不用這種時候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:08.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勞駕議長您親自下地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.91,0:15:12.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡也足以發佈指示
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並非這個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:21.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只會躲在後方搖旗吶喊的人注定不會有追隨者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾的行蹤還未查清
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:29.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說回來 真是難以估量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,群眾的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:33.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,令人敬畏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:36.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還未有所進展
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:38.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能演變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不過
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:43.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是被議長的演說激勵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.97,0:15:46.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望真正實現一個沒有戰爭的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:50.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然能 只要大家如此期望
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:53.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那這裡就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:01.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,維拉德隊發來的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:05.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖至今未能確認ArchAngel是否被擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:08.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但Freedom已確實被擊毀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:11.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這算是「將軍」了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不能大意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,白棋的皇后仍是個強敵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:25.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與庫拉傑克取得聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:26.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:29.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,詢問上次強奪穿梭機一案的調查進展情況
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:30.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:37.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是直布羅陀港口塔台
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:41.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎LHM 战列舰01 Minerva抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將誘導貴艦進入2號船塢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請確認標識
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是Minerva 瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認標識
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:55.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然事先知道附近全軍都收到了集結命令
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:01.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如此看來還真壯觀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:10.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,欲起干戈 先立其大義
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:13.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然忘記是誰的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:17.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,士官講習班的教官曾這麼說過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是理所當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:31.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不讓人明白敵人是誰 以及其理由
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:33.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都不會戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:38.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在這些都明明白白地擺在我們眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:43.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為軍人應該值得慶幸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:45.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:49.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦即將開始直布羅陀的入港程序
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:52.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各乘員請進入工作崗位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:53.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:56.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入直布羅陀後
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們接下來該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:06.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 根據前些日子議長的演說推測
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該會展開作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要攻打Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:16.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長自己不也說很難嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:19.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 一定是覺得無論如何必須去做了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:22.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看到那種慘狀後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真不感興趣嗎 與Logos作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:32.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:38.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽完議長的話後 我很感動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:43.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長明知很難卻毫不退縮 不言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:49.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這是真正能結束戰爭的唯一方法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:19:00.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 我也能和任何敵人戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:11.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入港完成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:17.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保安人員及維修班 艦務A班立刻開始工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:18.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:23.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基地司令部命令真 飛鳥和阿斯蘭 薩拉前去報到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:35.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 這是否能成為最後的王牌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:46.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:49.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  阿斯蘭 薩拉已經帶來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,久違了 議長
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:04.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前些日子的演說令人非常感動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:06.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:09.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也聽說了你們的活躍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然發生很多事 你們幹得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:14.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:20.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:22.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:25.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好想你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:29.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見 拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:34.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你們也已得知
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.87,0:20:39.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是事態所迫 我還是闖下大禍了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:43.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 怎麼說是闖禍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:46.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有很多話想與你們說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先來看看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:52.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才開始就注意到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:16.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZGMF-X42S Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZGMF-X666S Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:26.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩台都是遠勝過以往機體的最新機型
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細資料你們過會可以得知
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:34.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,它們應該會成為今後戰爭中的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:38.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:41.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的新機體
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:46.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的新…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:47.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.85,0:23:28.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥吧 激勵人們為夢想戰鬥的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.23,0:23:32.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這會實現什麼 而又奪去什麼
